9. Let the applicant-Avinash be released on bail in Case Crime No. 317 of 2022, under Sections 363,
366, 376 IPC, Section 3(2)(b) SC/ST Act and Sections 3/4 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012, registered at Police Station Jalalpur, District Ambedkar Nagar on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

